    - fx_trails
  - name: tonemap_final
    type: tonemapTOP
    parameters:
      exposurebias: 0.95
    position:
    - 1600
    - 0
    size:
    - 130
    - 90
    color:
    - 0.67
    - 0.67
    - 0.67
    inputs:
    - bloom_glow
  annotations:
  - name: annotate1
    mode: annotate
    title: Final composite
    text: The brain is composited over the blurred background, then the trails (feedback_trails from lib/) are added as light,
      followed by glow and an ACES tone map that rolls the highlights off instead of clipping them. Persistence drives the
      comet length, Glow the halo.
    position:
    - -70
    - -470
    size:
    - 2270
    - 770
