- name: ctrl_signal
  type: baseCOMP
  custom_pars:
    Custom:
    - name: Smoothing
      style: Float
      startSection: true
      default: 0.85
      max: 0.99
      clampMin: true
      clampMax: true
      normMax: 0.99
      help: 'Signal inertia: higher means the brain reacts more slowly and more gently.'
      value: 0
    - name: Excitation
      style: Float
      default: 0.5
      clampMin: true
      clampMax: true
      help: 'Simulated activity level: 0 is complete rest and a frozen shape, 1 is maximum agitation.'
      value: 0
    - name: Source
      style: Menu
      default: mock
      menuNames:
      - mock
      - osc
      menuLabels:
      - Mock (bruit simule)
      - OSC (casque EEG)
      help: 'Where the signal comes from: the simulated noise, or an EEG headset connected over OSC.'
      value: osc
  position:
  - 0
  - -1600
  children:
  - name: out1
    type: outCHOP
    parameters:
      label: =me.name
      autoexportroot: =parent()
    position:
    - 1400
    - 0
    size:
    - 130
    - 90
    color:
    - 0.67
    - 0.67
    - 0.67
    inputs:
    - limit_clamp
  - name: const_osc
    type: constantCHOP
    sequences:
      const:
      - name: alpha
      - name: beta
      - name: theta
    position:
    - 400
    - -400
  - name: math_norm
    type: mathCHOP
    parameters:
      fromrange1: -1
    position:
    - 200
    - 0
    inputs:
    - noise_eeg
  - name: noise_eeg
    type: noiseCHOP
    parameters:
      period: 6
      tz: =absTime.seconds * 0.15
      channelname: alpha beta theta
      end: 0
      rate: =me.time.rate
      autoexportroot: =parent()
    size:
    - 130
    - 90
    color:
    - 0.67
    - 0.67
    - 0.67
  - name: oscin_eeg
    type: oscinCHOP
    parameters:
      active: =parent().par.Source.menuIndex == 1
      autoexportroot: =parent()
    position:
    - 400
    - -600
    size:
    - 130
    - 90
    color:
    - 0.67
    - 0.67
    - 0.67
  - name: lag_smooth
    type: lagCHOP
    parameters:
      lag1: =parent().par.Smoothing.eval() * 2
      lag2: =parent().par.Smoothing.eval() * 2
      autoexportroot: =parent()
    position:
    - 400
    - 0
    size:
    - 130
    - 90
    color:
    - 0.67
    - 0.67
    - 0.67
    inputs:
    - math_norm
  - name: limit_clamp
    type: limitCHOP
    parameters:
      type: clamp
      min: 0
      autoexportroot: =parent()
    position:
    - 1200
    - 0
    size:
    - 130
    - 90
    color:
    - 0.67
    - 0.67
    - 0.67
    inputs:
    - switch_source
  - name: math_excite
    type: mathCHOP
    parameters:
      gain: =parent().par.Excitation.eval() * 0.55
      postoff: =parent().par.Excitation.eval() * 0.45
    position:
    - 600
    - 0
    inputs:
    - lag_smooth
  - name: replace_osc
    type: replaceCHOP
    parameters:
      autoexportroot: =parent()
    position:
    - 800
    - -400
    size:
    - 130
    - 90
    color:
    - 0.67
    - 0.67
    - 0.67
    inputs:
    - const_osc
    - oscin_eeg
  - name: switch_source
    type: switchCHOP
    parameters:
      index: =parent().par.Source.menuIndex
      autoexportroot: =parent()
    position:
    - 1000
    - 0
    size:
    - 130
    - 90
    color:
    - 0.67
    - 0.67
    - 0.67
    inputs:
    - math_excite
    - replace_osc
  annotations:
  - name: annotate
    mode: annotate
    title: Normalized EEG signal
    text: The only entry point for the signal. Simulated noise (alpha, beta, theta) is mapped to 0-1, smoothed by Smoothing,
      scaled by Excitation, then clamped. The OSC branch opens its socket only when Source switches to osc; the constant guarantees
      three channels even with no headset.
    position:
    - -70
    - -670
    size:
    - 1670
    - 930
    color:
    - 0.45
    - 0.45
    - 0.45
- name: out_fx_pulse
  type: nullPOP
  position:
  - 1600
  - -600
  inputs:
  - fx_pulse
- name: out_bg_aurora
  type: nullTOP
  position:
  - 2800
  - -1600
  inputs:
  - bg_aurora
- name: out_src_cloud
  type: nullPOP
  position:
  - 400
  - -600
  inputs:
  - src_cloud
- name: out_ctrl_signal
  type: nullCHOP
  parameters:
    autoexportroot: =parent()
  position:
  - 400
  - -1600
  size:
  - 130
  - 90
  color:
  - 0.67
  - 0.67
  - 0.67
  inputs:
  - ctrl_signal
annotations:
- name: annotate
  mode: networkbox
  title: 7. Control panel
  text: 'Perform window: the render as background, the six stages'' parameters top right.'
  position:
  - 4730
  - -670
  size:
  - 670
  - 370
  color:
  - 0.45
  - 0.45
  - 0.45
- name: annotate1
  mode: networkbox
  title: 1. EEG signal
  text: Normalizes and smooths the three bands to 0-1. The only entry point for the signal.
  position:
  - -70
  - -1670
  size:
  - 670
  - 370
  color:
  - 0.45
  - 0.45
  - 0.45
- name: annotate2
  mode: networkbox
  title: 2. Point cloud
  text: Loads the brain surface ply with its normals, seeds and decimates by Density.
  position:
  - -70
  - -670
  size:
  - 670
  - 370
  color:
  - 0.45
  - 0.45
  - 0.45
- name: annotate3
  mode: networkbox
  title: 3. Pulsation
  text: Breathing, activity focus, colour and lighting of the points, on the GPU.
  position:
  - 1130
  - -670
  size:
  - 670
  - 370
  color:
  - 0.45
  - 0.45
  - 0.45
- name: annotate4
  mode: networkbox
  title: 4. Render
  text: Additive sprites, sweeping camera, mouse rotation, depth cues.
  position:
  - 2330
  - -670
  size:
  - 670
  - 370
  color:
  - 0.45
  - 0.45
  - 0.45
- name: annotate5
  mode: networkbox
  title: 5. Aurora background
  text: Sky blue veils drifting over deep navy, bounded so they stay behind the brain.
  position:
  - 2330
  - -1670
  size:
  - 670
  - 370
  color:
  - 0.45
  - 0.45
  - 0.45
- name: annotate6
  mode: networkbox
  title: 6. Composite
  text: Trails, composite over the background, glow and tone map. Final output.
  position:
  - 3530
  - -670
  size:
  - 670
  - 370
  color:
  - 0.45
  - 0.45
  - 0.45
note: The six pipeline stages plus the control panel. Embody (tagged tdxn_exclude) and its externalizations table are out
  of this export.
